          <p class="tx">Combine the services you need into one plan, with one point of contact.</p>
          <div class="inc">
            <div><span class="cb"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><p><b>Snow removal</b><span>Lot and driveway plowing, sidewalk and entrance shoveling, salting and de-icing, and seasonal snow contracts.</span></p></div>
