            <div><span class="cb"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><p><b>Landscape maintenance</b><span>Lawn maintenance and mowing, bush and tree trimming, leaf, fall and spring cleanups, mulch installation and weeding.</span></p></div>
