            <div><span class="cb"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></span><p><b>Landscape install &amp; upgrades</b><span>Planting (trees, shrubs, garden beds), new lawn installation, and entrance and curb appeal upgrades.</span></p></div>
          </div>
        </section>
