            <li><span class="n">02</span><p><b>One plan, one invoice</b><span>We put together the services you need, with one call and one invoice.</span></p></li>
            <li><span class="n">03</span><p><b>Year-round service</b><span>Snow removal in winter, and cleanups, grounds care and construction the rest of the year.</span></p></li>
