            <details><summary>What commercial services do you offer?<span class="pm"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p>Snow removal, cleanups, landscape maintenance, small construction (masonry, carpentry, concrete and pavers, retaining walls, asphalt repair, fencing) and landscape install and upgrades.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Can you handle snow removal and grounds care together?<span class="pm"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p>Yes. One team covers snow removal in winter and landscape maintenance, cleanups and small construction the rest of the year, with one call and one invoice.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Do you offer seasonal snow contracts?<span class="pm"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p>Yes. Seasonal snow contracts are available, so snow removal is planned before the first storm.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Is the assessment free?<span class="pm"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p>Yes. We visit the property and follow up with a written quote. There's no charge and no obligation.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Are you licensed and insured?<span class="pm"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p>Yes, Euro Style Landscape is licensed and insured.</p></details>
            <details><summary>Which areas do you serve?<span class="pm"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></summary><p>We're based in Sayreville and work in towns across Middlesex, Monmouth and Union counties, including Old Bridge, East Brunswick, Woodbridge, Marlboro and Freehold.</p></details>
